WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.375
Some recent work by E. Fermi and L. Szilard,

2
00:00:03.695 --> 00:00:07.050
which has been communicated to me in manuscript,

3
00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:14.140
leads me to expect that the element uranium may be turned into a new and important source of energy

4
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:16.048
in the immediate future.
